/-!
# Part 2 of the shipped multiply-accumulate, checked in two halves

The part check of part 2 reduces a symbolic run of the whole part in `decide +kernel`;
this module checks the part as two runs, split after segment 8 of `scmSegs 2`, joined
at the boundary certificate `scmCut02`. The certificate is the symbolic state at the
boundary, produced by `scripts/cutgen/Ed25519ScMuladdCutAll.lean` from the same executor
outside the kernel. The second half starts at slot 94, one past the last slot the
certificate mentions.

## Main results

* `scm_part02a`, `scm_part02b`: the two half checks.
* `scm_part02_of_halves`: the conclusion `partCheck_sound` draws from the whole-part
  check, derived from the two halves.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option Elab.async false
set_option exponentiation.threshold 600

namespace CatCrypt.Crypto.SecureCompilation.Ascent.Demos.Ed25519ScMuladdShippedProof

open CatCrypt.Crypto.SecureCompilation.X86Backend.Jasmin
open CatCrypt.Crypto.SecureCompilation.Ascent.AddrMem
